  "description": "Handler-based HTTP client testing for Compono - TestHttpHandler is a reflection-free HttpMessageHandler subclass giving tests request matching (OnGet/OnPost/etc. + When(...)), last-match-wins dispatch, strict unmatched-request behavior, registration-handle verification, and a thread-safe request log, so code built on real HttpClient/HttpMessageHandler can be tested without a hand-rolled reflection-based fake.",
